<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Hardware/BulkHardware> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note> "Products or commodities produced as a bulk unit are called bulk products. Commodities are often sold in bulk based on a batch or bulk ID number associated with the bulk unit.\nBulk units defined in the QUDT Units standards."@en .
